          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.16.19+ACT.16.20+ACT.16.21+ACT.16.22+ACT.16.23+ACT.16.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 16:19–24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.1+ACT.17.2+ACT.17.3+ACT.17.4+ACT.17.5+ACT.17.6+ACT.17.7+ACT.17.8+ACT.17.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 17:1–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnamanya hurivyohenderwa mambo mai na kulaphizwa ni atu a mudzi wa Filipi na vira hurivyogaya hiko kabila ya kpwedza kpwenu. Ela Mlungu wahupha nguvu za kutangaza nenore",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chiyunani chinaamba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "injili ya Mlungu.",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Dza vivyo kpwenye misitari ya 2:8 na 2:9 piya.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " bila wuoga, hata dzagbwe kala hukazangirwa ni hinyo ariohupinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahubiri gehu tagayategemea handzo au nia mbii hipho huriphokuambirani mumkubali Jesu, wala tahulondere kuchenga mutu yeyesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badala ya hivyo Mlungu wahuona hu atu a kuaminika na a kufwaha kutangaza habari nono kuhusu Jesu Muokoli. Naswi tahugomba kufurahisha atu, ela hunalonda kumuhamira Mlungu amanyaye hata mioyo yehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mwi enye mnamanya kukala tahuyahumira maneno ga mtswano kpwa mkubali. Wala tahuyahumira werevu kudzifwitsa ili hufwaidike kula kpwenu, hata ye Mlungu ni shaidi wehu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wala tahuyalonda kulikpwa ni atu, akale ni mwimwi au mutu wanjina yeyesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa vira hu mitume a Jesu, hungeonyesa uwezo wehu na kuvoya mambo fulani kula kpwenu. Ela swino hwakala a pole kpwenu dza mchetu areraye anae atsanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hwakumendzani sana hata tahuyakushirikishani neno ra Mlungu macheye, ela piya maisha gehu, mana hwasagala phamwenga kama chitu chimwenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, ikale tamtambukira hurivyohenda kazi kpwa chadi? Wakati huriphokutangazirani neno ra Mlungu, hwahenda kazi usiku na mutsi, ili maitaji gehu gasikale mzigo kpwenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwimwi mu mashaidi gehu dza viratu Mlungu, kukala maisha gehu hiko kpwenu gakala manono na ga haki bila lawama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mnamanya vira hurivyohendera chila mmwenga dza viratu baba ahenderavyo anae mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hwakutiyani moyo, huchikuphani pore na huchizidi kukuambirani muishi maisha gamhamirago Mlungu. Mana wakutsambulani mtawale phamwenga naye na mphahe nguma dza iye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
