          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona huna sababu yanjina ya kumshukuru Mlungu chila wakati. Huriphokureherani ujumbe wa Mlungu, tamyausikira na kuuphokera dza ujumbe wa mwanadamu, ela mwauphokera dza ujumbe wa Mlungu, na kpwa kpweli ndio. Nao unagaluza maisha genu mwimwi mukuluphirao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.17.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 17:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, gago garigohendeka kpwenu gahenderwa makundi ga afuasi a Jesu Muokoli ario jimbo ra Judea. Kpwani vyo murivyogayiswa ni atu enu ndivyo afuasi a hiko Judea arivyogayiswa ni Ayahudi ayawao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
