        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enehu, huripholazimishwa kukurichani, hwatengbwa chimwiri swiswi na mwimwi kpwa muda, ela maazo gehu gachikala phamwenga namwi. Naswi hwajaribu chila njira kuuya tsona mana kala huna hamu ya kukuonani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kala hunalonda hwedze hukuloleni. Nami nájeza kano nyinji nedze nikuloleni, ela Shetani achinizuwiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiphoima mbere za Bwana Jesu wakati achedza, huna hakika kukala mundakala mcheremkuluphira. Phahi mundahuenda huphahe zawadi, naswi hundakala na ngulu na raha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kpweli munahuhenda hukale na ngulu na raha kpwa sababu ya tabiya na mahendo genu manono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
